{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this fun and thrilling casual game, we will take you back to the tense atmosphere of &quot;Squid Adventure 3D&quot; and launch you into a unique adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will play the role of a brave contestant who receives a mysterious invitation and joins this game of survival or death. The rules, derived from childhood games, conceal dangers. Each game appears simple but requires strategy and skill to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an adventure that will get your heart racing. Every victory will bring you rich rewards, and every failure is an opportunity to grow. Come and join the game, start your own adventure, and become the ultimate winner!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564790?t=1744164033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564790?t=1744164033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/0e7b456b02d59dbf18f7826957acfd637f1dce9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744164033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/0e7b456b02d59dbf18f7826957acfd637f1dce9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744164033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this fun and thrilling casual game, we will take you back to the tense atmosphere of &quot;Squid Adventure 3D&quot; and launch you into a unique adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will play the role of a brave contestant who receives a mysterious invitation and joins this game of survival or death. The rules, derived from childhood games, conceal dangers. Each game appears simple but requires strategy and skill to succeed.